## 1. SOAR

To run code for `SOAR` on the benchmarks:

1. In the `ChasingCarsExample` directory, use the following command to run the benchmark:

    ```
    poetry run python benchmarks -m <MODEL> -p <PROPERTY> -i <INSTANCE> -f <Folder for Results>
    ```

    Here are the follwoing combinations for MODEL, PROPERTY, and INSTANCE:

    | MODEL | INSTANCE | PROPERTY                                          |
    |----------|-------------|-------------------------------------------------------|
    | CC       | 1           | CC1, CC2, CC3, CC4, CC5, CCx                          |

    For example: To run CC1 property on the Chasing Cars (CC) model for instance 1 type of signals and store the result in the current directory, use the following command:

    ```
    poetry run python benchmarks -m CC -p CC1 -i 1 -f .
    ```